  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.75 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "0.75 teaspoon salt",
    "0.125 teaspoon pepper",
    "3 large eggs",
    "0.375 cup 2% milk",
    "3 tablespoons butter",
    "1.5 cups shredded Emmentaler cheese",
    "1 onion, sliced"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/W7poHU4ZxRSWolnsKi6k5v_NOzU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/KaeseSpaetzle_55224_DDMFS_Ingredients_Step1_2300-a4174f2f6d2f448a978462b89ed05a6c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/55224/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift together flour, nutmeg, salt, and pepper. Beat eggs in a medium bowl. Alternately mix in milk and flour mixture until smooth. Let stand for 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FtU-qiOltvLRx96fA09hqbuYtCQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/KaeseSpaetzle_55224_DDMFS_Step4_2309-b66862f972744d1da3ebb5b6460db03e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/55224/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Press batter through a spaetzle press into the water.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/y_Pysu7kD44-4Po4klKhIdKTLY8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/KaeseSpaetzle_55224_DDMFS_Step5_2350-effad2e43deb42adaa50e59966b76065.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/55224/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When spaetzle has floated to the top of the water, remove it to a bowl with a slotted spoon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/04q8VzEwaFFpt7kciNuMa5TDLy0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/KaeseSpaetzle_55224_DDMFS_Step6_2352-eca5b2361ee74b82a1cd740d755d9299.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/55224/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in 1 cup of the cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XiuO9RDD8TZryr_1Nq6ihuOpzms=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/KaeseSpaetzle_55224_DDMFS_Step7_2356-fed1d8b1109e4397adda412f53bc8830.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/55224/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Add onion and cook until golden. Stir in spaetzle and remaining 1/2 cup cheese until well blended. Remove from heat, and serve immediately.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9ppmTm-xNTfvvpEs7zaR-TBRfck=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/KaeseSpaetzle_55224_DDMFS_Step9_2369-d3dcd4ddbc534c3388ab3ccb46d3ba4b.jpg"
      ],
